  "ingredients": [
    "30 crushed peppermint hard candies, divided",
    "1.5 pounds milk chocolate candy, coarsely chopped",
    "1.5 pounds white chocolate, chopped",
    "1 teaspoon oil-based peppermint flavoring, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q7HAhdtBedkv-15hQ1PCZJSOHtc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-217827-peppermint-bark-VAT-4x3-step-01-750b589cf97f45d1bae57cd76f34d05e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217827/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread 1/3 of the peppermint candy over a 9x13-inch baking pan lined with wax paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dapOJOHNvtp_uw6G8XqWR7LSZm8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-217827-peppermint-bark-VAT-4x3-step-02-a8e2c210de364224a2b62d2daea18e1a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217827/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt the milk chocolate in the top of a double boiler over just-barely simmering water, stirring frequently and scraping down the sides with a rubber spatula to avoid scorching, just until melted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hg4pdg-G5FyHvl38xZrQDxCy2do=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-217827-peppermint-bark-VAT-4x3-step-03-37ccafdd60f2464181a523957222099a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217827/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the melted chocolate over peppermint candy in the prepared pan. Sprinkle another 1/3 of the candy on top of the milk chocolate. Refrigerate until the chocolate hardens, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4mxUxSiIEFJ4sY53SpFIJ9vtmMM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-217827-peppermint-bark-VAT-4x3-step-04-907df89623e542058eaad3c5b778069f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217827/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt the white chocolate in the top of a double boiler over just-barely simmering water, stirring frequently and scraping down the sides with a rubber spatula to avoid scorching. Stir in the oil-based peppermint flavoring.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZzurtIwWloM1IDJzeoILXV05a-Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-217827-peppermint-bark-VAT-4x3-step-05-358ef0a82553467bab501aae9558a7a0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217827/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the white chocolate over the milk chocolate, then spread the remaining 1/3 peppermint candy on top. Refrigerate until the white chocolate hardens, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BbQeGs5dyuLNvAqvKhhTN9RRO0E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-217827-peppermint-bark-VAT-4x3-step-06-a642b4a67cbe4953b89714670f38a7c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217827/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut or break into pieces to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JxhP_DD5RrBKyg5Rwp7eXLzvDhU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-217827-peppermint-bark-VAT-4x3-step-07-e350f9dbdf1840e29d6dbac74ae31475.jpg"
